untitled-ontology-3:affects rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                            rdfs:domain untitled-ontology-3:Incident ;
                            rdfs:range untitled-ontology-3:ITResource .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#assignedTo
