                            rdfs:range untitled-ontology-3:ITResource .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#reportedBy
untitled-ontology-3:reportedBy rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                               rdfs:domain untitled-ontology-3:Incident ;
                               rdfs:range untitled-ontology-3:Person .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#usesResource
untitled-ontology-3:usesResource rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#usesTechnology
untitled-ontology-3:usesTechnology rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#worksOn
untitled-ontology-3:worksOn rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
