                        untitled-ontology-3:manages untitled-ontology-3:DatabaseServer01 ;
                        untitled-ontology-3:worksOn untitled-ontology-3:BankingProject .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#BankingApplication
