###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#BankingProject
untitled-ontology-3:BankingProject rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                            untitled-ontology-3:Project ;
                                   owl:differentFrom untitled-ontology-3:MobileAppProject .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#DatabaseServer01
untitled-ontology-3:DatabaseServer01 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
