                                              untitled-ontology-3:Server .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#Incident101
untitled-ontology-3:Incident101 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                         untitled-ontology-3:Incident ;
                                untitled-ontology-3:affects untitled-ontology-3:WebServer01 .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#MobileAppProject
untitled-ontology-3:MobileAppProject rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                              untitled-ontology-3:Project .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/muhammadabdulrehma/ontologies/2026/9/untitled-ontology-3#Sara
untitled-ontology-3:Sara rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                  untitled-ontology-3:SystemAdministrator ;
